Z||000006||My7Fieros||09-09-2000||02:40 PM||||It was really tacky and in bad taste Haze...I was in a particularly bad mood at the time I read the post and replied w/something about "going to the bathroom to take a mustang"..(think about it)...<BR>I edited it out and put whats there now. I knew that I was only putting it there because of my bad mood. <BR>See, I really really like Fieros, and Ive always had this bitter taste in my mouth about Mustangs. So when I hear someone on here talking about how a Mustang is better or faster or whatever than a Fiero, it usually rubs me the wrong way. I figure somewhere there is a Mustang Forum where Mustang owners can go on and on about how speical their precious cars are. Here I look to read about Fieros. <BR>Anyway, like I said, it was really tacky and I dont want to offend anyone. After re-reading the topic, I realized it was just an inside joke between the two of you. Sorry. ||||reg||1
